rule line_total v1
description "Two fields of one element Go, Swift, Java and the .proto spell alike"

elements lines
  unit_fee : money[USD]  range >=0USD <=100USD
  unitFee  : money[USD]  range >=0USD <=100USD

outputs
  total : money[USD]  round down(1USD)

sum spent over lines of unit_fee  range >=0USD <=1000USD
sum back over lines of unitFee  range >=0USD <=1000USD

define total : money[USD] = spent + back
